              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "If you are looking for the thin, lightweight, and breathable shirts in the Columbia **PFG (Performance Fishing Gear)** line, they are called different names depending on the style of the shirt:\n\n---\n\n### 1. The Thin, Lightweight Button-Ups\nIf you are looking for the thin, lightweight button-down collar shirts, the models you want are:\n\n* **Tamiami (e.g., Tamiami II):** This is the **ultimate \"thin\" button-up PFG shirt**. It is made from an ultra-lightweight, 100% polyester ripstop fabric that is incredibly thin, silky, and quick to dry. It features snap-up buttons and is highly ventilated.\n* **Slack Tide / Super Slack Tide:** Another highly popular, lightweight, and thin polyester button-up. It features a slightly more casual cut and is famous for its breathable, ventilated back panel and fun patterns.\n* **Low Drag Offshore:** Made of a lightweight polyester/elastane blend, this shirt is thin, has built-in stretch, and offers a slightly modern, less baggy fit.\n\n**How they compare to other button-ups:**\n* **Bahama II:** These are often confused with the Tamiami, but they are made of **nylon**, which is stiffer, crinklier, and heavier. \n* **Bonehead:** These are made of **100% cotton**, which is much heavier and holds onto sweat/moisture.\n\n---\n\n### 2. The Thin, Long-Sleeve Sun Shirts (T-Shirt / Hoodie Style)\nIf you are looking for the thin, silky, stretchy long-sleeve shirts (often used for sun protection or as rash guards), they are called:\n\n* **Terminal Tackle (Men's / Unisex):** This is the incredibly popular, thin, long-sleeve crewneck or sun hoodie. It is made of a lightweight, silky polyester fabric with UPF 50 sun protection that feels cool to the touch.\n* **Tidal Tee (Women's):** This is the exact women\u2019s version of the Terminal Tackle\u2014a very thin, lightweight, moisture-wicking polyester sun shirt.",
